msgstr "Hinnanguline tugevus"

msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Kogu hoidla sisu krüptitakse uue parooliga uuesti. Varem tehtud varukoopiad "
"avanevad endiselt parooliga, millega need tehti."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Kõik on sünkroonis"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Kõik taastub koopia tegemise aegsesse olekusse, sh manused ja paroolide "
"ajalugu. Hiljem loodud kirjed kaovad. Praegune hoidla säilitatakse selle "
"kõrval failina."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Kõik oli juba sünkroonitud"

msgid "Export complete"
msgstr "Eksportimine lõpetatud"

msgid "Export failed"
msgstr "Eksportimine ebaõnnestus"

msgid "Export to KeePass"
msgstr "Ekspordi KeePassi"

msgid "Export to KeePass or to a file anyone can read"
msgstr "Ekspordi KeePassi või faili, mida igaüks saab lugeda"

