msgstr "Hangivad ja kuvavad saidiikoonid võlviku kirjete kõrval"

msgid "Fetching remote passwords"
msgstr "Kaugparoolide toomine"

msgid "Files are encrypted and stored inside the vault."
msgstr "Failid krüptitakse ja salvestatakse hoidlasse."

msgid "Filesystem"
msgstr "Failisüsteem<br>"

msgid "Fill in all three fields."
msgstr "Täida kõik kolm välja."

msgid "Findings"
msgstr "Leiud"

msgid "Finishing synchronization"
msgstr "Sünkroonimise lõpetamine"

msgid ""
"First export your passwords from the other app, then choose that file here. "
"Before importing you will see what was recognized. Delete unprotected export "
"files afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Ekspordi esmalt paroolid teisest rakendusest ja vali see fail siin. Enne "
"importimist näed, mis tuvastati. Kustuta kaitsmata ekspordifailid hiljem."

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "Kaust"

msgid "Folder created"
msgstr "Kaust loodud"

msgid "Folder name"
msgstr "Kausta nimi"

msgid "Folder removed. Its passwords were kept."
msgstr "Kaust eemaldatud. Selle paroolid säilitati."

msgid "Folder renamed"
msgstr "Kaust ümber nimetatud"

msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Kaustad"

msgid ""
"Folders organize your passwords. You can choose them when adding or editing."
msgstr ""
"Kaustad aitavad paroole korrastada. Saad need valida lisamisel või muutmisel."

msgid "Follow the system"
msgstr "Järgi süsteemi"

msgid ""
"For Nextcloud, the base URL looks like https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/"
"dav/files/USERNAME"
msgstr ""
"Nextcloudi puhul näeb baas-URL välja selline: https://cloud.example.com/"
"remote.php/dav/files/KASUTAJANIMI"

msgid ""
"From another app: create your vault first, then open Backups → Import "
"passwords.\n"
"\n"
"From a copy made by Ashy Pass: restore it now. The vault will open with the "
"master password of the copy."
msgstr ""
"Teisest rakendusest: loo esmalt hoidla, seejärel ava Varukoopiad → Impordi "
"paroolid.\n"
"\n"
"Ashy Passi tehtud koopiast: taasta see kohe. Hoidla avaneb koopia "
"põhiparooliga."

msgid "Generate Backup Phrase"
msgstr "Loo varufraas"

msgid "Generate another"
msgstr "Loo uus"

msgid "Generate password"
msgstr "Loo parool"

msgid "Generated password"
msgstr "Loodud parool"

msgid "Give this access a name, for example the site or app."
msgstr "Anna kirjele nimi, näiteks saidi või rakenduse nimi."

msgid "Go to search"
msgstr "Mine otsingusse"

msgid "Google Drive"
msgstr "Google Drive"

msgid "Google Drive and WebDAV"
msgstr "Google Drive ja WebDAV"

msgid "Helps SSD wear-leveling but leaks free-space patterns to the device."
msgstr ""
"Aitab SSD kulumise tasakaalustamisel, kuid lekib vaba ruumi mustreid "
"seadmele.<br>"

msgid "Hide password"
msgstr "Peida parool"

msgid ""
"Higher costs slow down guessing attacks and also slow down unlocking. Auto-"
"tune picks values for about half a second on this computer; they apply the "
"next time the master password is set or changed."
msgstr ""
"Suurem kulu aeglustab äraarvamisrünnakuid, aga ka avamist. Automaathäälestus "
"valib väärtused, mis võtavad selles arvutis umbes pool sekundit; need "
"rakenduvad järgmisel põhiparooli määramisel või muutmisel."

